            "id": "p-185537c4545f2d27"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The lyre strings need to be doused in Phagousa's holy water for their divine powers to manifest"
