          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Score Information"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. [-] indicates a fermata, one beat for every cell"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. The twelve-string tuning symbols indicate the base pitch, and actual pitch fluctuates according to water level"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. The score corresponds with the twelve strings' positions from top to bottom"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-0966201185b965cf"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Performance Notes"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "This score is only recorded with standard melodic phrases, and actual performance is influenced by the following factors:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. During the rising tide, the pitch naturally rises as well"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. The timbre becomes more sonorous during quicker currents"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. The harmony becomes richer when storms descend"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "4. When a performance takes place along a coast, resonance is amplified"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-bf14e20c157d718b"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Special Performance Influences"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "≈ Wave Sounds: Produced during intense currents"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "↑ Rising Tide Sounds: Pitch rises with the water level"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "↓ Receding Tide Sounds: Pitch lowers with the water level"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "～ Afterecho: Persists as flow changes"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6c8a7deb4a96d04a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "[Reminder]"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. Please do not perform when during black tide disasters"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. Phagousa's holy water must be imbibed first before battle"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. Please protect the lyre from water when performing in storms"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "4. Beware of Zagreus' disciples who may secretly replace the lyre's strings"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3e825ca023c56714"
          }
        ]
      }
